            "review_title": "Review at The Tavern",
            "review_text": "Meander34951238464\n7 contributions\n0\nDelicious roast and a real taste of home !\nMar 2024 • Couples\nOn Easter Sunday and after three months of travel around Asia and eating only local food , I was feeling very home sick . After searching in jest for a roast dinner in Ho Chi Min City , I found this place and hopped into a taxi ( on a steaming hot day ) . \nThere was a huge welcome , a big smile , a cool haven and more importantly the very best roast beef dinner waiting for us , which included amazing roast potatoes , proper veg , a Yorkie and horseradish sauce . It was piping hot , cooked to perfection and made Easter Day 24 one to remember . Thank you so much … it was a real tonic . Can’t recommend this enough\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nWell Worth the grab ride . Restaurant is in a nice area and worth a look around .\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 1, 2024",
