            "review_text": "Riki M\nRathdowney, Australia66 contributions\n0\nFriendly place to unwind, cool down, enjoy cold drinks and delicious food\nJan 2024 • Couples\nA great little bar/restaurant we found in district 7 from reviews. After weeks of Vietnamese food and music it was a great change with an exceptional atmosphere of welcoming staff, yummy food, great music and Hoa made us the most delicious cocktails from off and on the menu. He really is a master at cocktail making. Played dominos and drank/ate the afternoon away in a great little hang out. \n\nI will crave the bruschetta when I leave… yummmmm\nRead more\nWritten January 18, 2024",
