            "review_text": "Thái P\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat pub in District 7 with friendly staffs and games on\nJul 2023 • Friends\nThis place is just the best one that I've been.\nWelcoming and friendly staffs, they have humors too.\nFood taste good, lunch set for 225k with 3 courses very nice.\nOn tuesday they have Buy 1 get 1 free special fresh pizza, and the same BOGO for Cocktails on every Thursday.\n\nThis pub looks like always have some entertaiment for customers to never get boring: poker, pool billards , dart, also their live sport games really cool.\n\nHighly recommend for best place to hang out, either alone or with friends.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 23, 2023",
