            "review_title": "Review at The Tavern",
            "review_text": "Phillip B\nChicago, Illinois69 contributions\n2\nStaff unable to control drunken patrons\nApr 2021\nDecently priced beer. Ok food. Nice pub decor. The problem lies with the staff's inability to control rowdy and/or violent customers. If there is more than one rowdy customer, the staff allows them to do whatever -- even if the rowdiness becomes physical. If you run afoul of an angry drunk, you're on your own. Go somewhere else. There's no shortage of options in D7.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 22, 2021",
