            "review_text": "Traveler of the Wild\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam66 contributions\n0\nContinues to be the most authentic and honest British pub in Saigon\nNov 2019\nQuintessentially British. Welsh owner who takes pride in his pub. A wide menu of good solid British food you can get your teeth into. A couple of local craft beers on tap and the full range of wines and spirits. Pub quiz, regular live music and as close as you'll get in Vietnam to a proper British welcome. Highly recommended- especially 'Mum's Meat Pie'\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 12, 2019",
