            "review_title": "Review at The Tavern",
            "review_text": "Leean W\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam206 contributions\n1\nFantastic Sunday Roast at the Tavern\nAug 2019 • Friends\nHad my first Sunday roast at The Tavern which was outstanding. The roast was a lamb dinner this week but the kind owner, or maybe chef, Neil, came to our table and kindly agreed to change the lamb for chicken. The chicken was well cooked and succulent, the gravy very tasty, the roast potatoes were the best in town being the only roasties I know in Ho Chi Minh that are crispy on the outside and soft and fluffy on the inside. The veggies were also cooked to perfection and the yorkshire pud was spot on. Its a shame I live rather far away in D2 but I will definitely make the effort to travel to The Tavern for Sunday roast again.Final mention of the warm and friendly welcome of Neil and staff.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 2, 2019",
